{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "Thank you, Dr. Morgan. I'd like to share my findings from the family-consent review. My review confirms that interviewees I2, I5, I9, I14, and I18 have not granted permission for public web publication. Their recordings may be used only in the school's internal archive, and the plan must include a consent-exclusion record. This means the current draft plan's call for publication of all recordings on the public school website would need to be modified to exclude these five interviewees' recordings from public publication."}
```

